// Per-state workers' compensation exemption detail.
//
// PROVENANCE: researched 2026-08-30 against official state sources (workers' comp
// commissions/boards/divisions, state statute text, departments of insurance). Every record
// carries the URLs actually fetched in `sources` and an `asOf` for the source material.
//
// HONESTY RULE, deliberately preserved from the previous build: a field that could not be
// verified against an official source is `null` and explained in `notes` — it is NEVER guessed.
// Publishing an invented form number, fee or statute cite would be worse than publishing nothing.
// `confidence` reflects how much of the record came from a primary source.
//
// Josh is fine-tuning these state by state and supplying the exemption forms, so treat this as
// a researched starting point, not a final legal reference.

