    soleProprietor: "Not automatically covered — every sole proprietor may elect TO BE covered under the Act (820 ILCS 305/3(20)); absent that election, the sole proprietor is excluded from the Act's coverage as to themselves. (Sole proprietors' employees, if any, are covered regardless.)",
